1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:02,146
Agar aap har minute aadhe ho jao toh?

2
00:00:02,256 --> 00:00:03,479
8 minute mein cheenti,

3
00:00:03,499 --> 00:00:04,998
aur 15 minute mein gaayab.

4
00:00:05,108 --> 00:00:05,715
Kaise?

5
00:00:05,965 --> 00:00:08,164
Aap 1.7 metre ke ho.

6
00:00:08,274 --> 00:00:10,309
Pehle minute mein 85 centimetre,

7
00:00:10,329 --> 00:00:11,708
aur kapde tent ban gaye.

8
00:00:11,818 --> 00:00:12,822
Teesre minute mein,

9
00:00:12,842 --> 00:00:14,117
aapke phone jitne.

10
00:00:14,367 --> 00:00:15,533
Har baar height aadhi,

11
00:00:15,553 --> 00:00:17,227
toh weight aathvan hissa.

12
00:00:17,337 --> 00:00:19,754
Chhathe minute tak itne halke ki table se

13
00:00:19,774 --> 00:00:21,726
giro, phir bhi kuch nahi hoga.

14
00:00:21,976 --> 00:00:23,957
Aathve minute mein aap cheenti jitne.

15
00:00:24,067 --> 00:00:26,482
Ab paani ki ek boond bhi khatarnak hai.

16
00:00:26,592 --> 00:00:28,455
Uski surface tension mein phans gaye,

17
00:00:28,475 --> 00:00:29,693
toh nikal nahi paoge.

18
00:00:29,943 --> 00:00:31,902
Pandrahve minute mein aap insaani baal se

19
00:00:31,922 --> 00:00:32,781
bhi patle ho.

20
00:00:32,891 --> 00:00:34,791
Ab koi aapko dekh hi nahi sakta.

21
00:00:35,041 --> 00:00:37,737
Beesve minute mein aap ek bacteria jitne.

22
00:00:37,847 --> 00:00:39,444
Is size pe hawa mein chalna,

23
00:00:39,464 --> 00:00:41,725
gaadhe shahad mein tairne jaisa lagta hai.

24
00:00:41,975 --> 00:00:43,954
Aur lagbhag 33 minute mein,

25
00:00:43,974 --> 00:00:45,422
aap ek atom jitne.

26
00:00:45,532 --> 00:00:47,272
Yahan shrinking ruk jaati hai,

27
00:00:47,292 --> 00:00:49,272
kyunki aap atoms se hi bane ho.

28
00:00:49,522 --> 00:00:51,703
Aise "what if" ke liye WhatIfyTV ko

29
00:00:51,723 --> 00:00:53,074
subscribe karo.

30
00:00:53,184 --> 00:00:55,607
Aur batao, aap kaunse minute pe rukoge?
